{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18865","headline":"翰林白二十二学士见寄诗一百篇因以答贶 · 刘禹锡","name":"翰林白二十二学士见寄诗一百篇因以答贶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吟君遗我百篇诗，使我独坐形神驰。\n玉琴清夜人不语，琪树春朝风正吹。\n郢人斤斵无痕迹，仙人衣裳弃刀尺。\n世人方内欲相寻，行尽四维无处觅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18865.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18865","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}